 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** $O(N)$ for spatial mapping of $N$ Gaussians; compression time depends on the chosen image codec.
-*   **Memory Complexity:** $O(W \times H \times \text{num\_attributes})$ for the 2D grid storage.
-*   **Strengths:** Leverages mature, highly optimized image codecs; simple to implement and integrate.
-*   **Limitations:** Grid resolution limits spatial detail; collision handling requires explicit merging logic.
-*   **When to use:** When standard image compression is preferred for simplicity and compatibility.
-*   **When not to use:** When high spatial fidelity is required without grid quantization artifacts.
